<h1>You've Been Invited as an Administrator</h1>
<p>Hello {{userName}},</p>
<p><strong>{{inviterName}}</strong> has invited you to join the <strong>{{companyName}}</strong> workspace as a <strong>{{roleName}}</strong>.</p>

<p>Click the button below to accept your invitation and set up your administrative credentials:</p>

<div class="btn-container">
  <a href="{{inviteUrl}}" class="btn-primary">Accept Admin Invitation</a>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">
  This invitation link is intended solely for you and will expire in <strong>{{expiresInHours}} hours</strong>. If you were not expecting an invitation, you can ignore this email.
</p>
